 252:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c **** /** @defgroup CRC_Exported_Functions_Group2 Peripheral Control functions
 253:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   *  @brief    management functions.
 254:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   *
 255:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c **** @verbatim
 256:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 257:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****                       ##### Peripheral Control functions #####
 258:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****  ===============================================================================
 259:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****     [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
 260:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****       (+) compute the 7, 8, 16 or 32-bit CRC value of an 8, 16 or 32-bit data buffer
 261:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****           using combination of the previous CRC value and the new one.
 262:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c **** 
 263:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****        [..]  or
 264:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c **** 
 265:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****       (+) compute the 7, 8, 16 or 32-bit CRC value of an 8, 16 or 32-bit data buffer
 266:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****           independently of the previous CRC value.
