 331:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   *         type is * uint8_t, number of half-words if pBuffer type is * uint16_t,
 332:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   *         number of words if pBuffer type is * uint32_t).
 333:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   * @note  By default, the API expects a uint32_t pointer as input buffer parameter.
 334:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   *        Input buffer pointers with other types simply need to be cast in uint32_t
 335:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   *        and the API will internally adjust its input data processing based on the
 336:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   *        handle field hcrc->InputDataFormat.
 337:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_crc.c ****   * @retval uint32_t CRC (returned value LSBs for CRC shorter than 32 bits)
